<title>POLAND: RELPOL GROUP Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL GROUP Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Relpol preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    group operating profit			 3.16 vs	1.53</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			   4.95 vs	2.01</p>
<p>    group net profit				 3.10 vs	1.38</p>
<p>    group net sales				 22.39 vs     10.13</p>
<p>    group costs of sales			  17.11 vs	7.23</p>
<p>    group extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    group income tax				 1.31 vs	0.51</p>
<p>    group other taxes				0.27 vs	0.14</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		     8.14 vs	6.93</p>
<p>    group financial costs			  6.30 vs	6.44</p>
<p>    group investment				 4.05 vs	0.24</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
